WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.672
Day 7. Putting Together.

2
00:00:02.122 --> 00:00:10.123
Watch first. Show it with real things. The first one on the page is done for you. Then do one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:14.887
Put two things in one hand and one in the other. Ask: how many in all?

4
00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:18.559
Your child puts them together on the table and counts them all.

5
00:00:19.159 --> 00:00:23.600
Now show the sign. Plus means put together. Equals means the same as.

6
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.516
Job one: count both groups together, and write how many.

7
00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:35.445
Job two is a story sum. Read the story out loud. Your child acts it out with real things, then writes the answer.
